WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.890
Rosa counted dimes and quarters.

2
00:00:06.891 --> 00:00:10.654
"We have five dollars," she said.

3
00:00:10.655 --> 00:00:12.096
Jo grinned.

4
00:00:12.097 --> 00:00:16.409
"Now can we buy that magic kit?"

5
00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.309
"Not yet," said Rosa.

6
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.628
"But we can do a magic trick."

7
00:00:23.629 --> 00:00:26.753
"How?" asked Jo.

8
00:00:26.754 --> 00:00:30.753
"First, we need some lemons," said Rosa.

9
00:00:30.754 --> 00:00:42.598
"Then, we'll turn the lemons into money!"

10
00:00:42.599 --> 00:00:50.125
Later the twins set up a table and a sign.

11
00:00:50.126 --> 00:01:05.866
They had pitchers of lemonade and cups.

12
00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:09.732
A boy rode by on a bike.

13
00:01:09.733 --> 00:01:14.535
"Hey!" Rosa shouted. "Want some lemonade?

14
00:01:14.536 --> 00:01:21.272
It only costs two dollars!"

15
00:01:21.273 --> 00:01:25.092
"Two dollars for lemonade?" said the boy.

16
00:01:25.093 --> 00:01:31.753
"Are you crazy?"

17
00:01:31.754 --> 00:01:36.514
"Ice-cold lemonade!" Rosa shouted to a woman.

18
00:01:36.515 --> 00:01:40.435
The woman looked at the price.

19
00:01:40.436 --> 00:01:47.364
"No, thanks," she said.

20
00:01:47.365 --> 00:01:54.689
"Hmm...," thought Jo. "I have an idea!"

21
00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:58.747
Soon lots of people were buying lemonade.

22
00:01:58.748 --> 00:02:03.430
"Good idea, Jo," said Rosa.

23
00:02:03.431 --> 00:02:06.609
"Two dollars was too expensive.

24
00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:16.375
Fifty cents is a better price."

25
00:02:16.376 --> 00:02:18.752
"Look!" said Jo.

26
00:02:18.753 --> 00:02:21.631
"We made twenty dollars!

27
00:02:21.632 --> 00:02:24.452
I know what to buy now."

28
00:02:24.453 --> 00:02:27.132
"The magic kit?" asked Rosa.

29
00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:39.719
"Nope," said Jo. "More lemons!"

